=== base64 roundtrip
PRINT BASE64_ENCODE("Hello, World!")
PRINT BASE64_DECODE("SGVsbG8sIFdvcmxkIQ==")
PRINT BASE64_DECODE(BASE64_ENCODE("Umlaute: äöü"))
--- erwartet
SGVsbG8sIFdvcmxkIQ==
Hello, World!
Umlaute: äöü

=== crc32 known value
PRINT CRC32("hello")
--- erwartet
907060870

=== hash deterministic
PRINT HASH("hello") = HASH("hello")
PRINT HASH("a") = HASH("b")
--- erwartet
